Package: antarcticaSoilClassMapping
Type: Project
Title: Probability-Driven Soil Class Mapping in Antarctica
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rafael G.", "Siqueira", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "rafael.g.siqueira@ufv.br"),
    person("Cássio M.", "Moquedace", role = "aut"),
    person("Márcio R.", "Francelino", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Curated analytical scripts documenting the probability-based
    Random Forest workflow used to derive ranked Antarctic soil-class
    probabilities and uncertainty-aware soil mapping units. Source data are
    not distributed; final spatial products are archived separately on Zenodo.
License: MIT
URL: https://github.com/moquedace/antarctica_soil_class_mapping
BugReports: https://github.com/moquedace/antarctica_soil_class_mapping/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    caret,
    dplyr,
    terra
Encoding: UTF-8
